	{"id": "cactus_maze", "acts": [1], "title": "Far from Any Road",
		"text": "Far from any road, you find yourself lost in a maze of cactus, its walls taller than you and its spines longer than your fingers. Somewhere deeper in, a soft voice is humming.",
		"options": [{"label": "Ignite a spell to burn a way out", "pick_spell": true, "outcomes": [{"chance": 1.0, "text": "{spell} goes up in flames, and the fire eats a path straight through the cactus. You walk out, smelling of smoke.", "do": [{"op": "lose_spell"}]}]}, {"label": "Force your way out", "outcomes": [{"chance": 1.0, "text": "You push through the spines until you come out the other side. It hurts: you lose 5 HP.", "do": [{"op": "damage", "n": 5}]}]}, {"label": "Follow the voice", "outcomes": [{"chance": 1.0, "text": "You squeeze between the cacti towards the humming. The spines catch you on the way: you lose {n} HP. The voice is closer now, but so are the walls.", "do": [{"op": "damage", "min": 1, "max": 3}], "then": {"options": [{"label": "Ignite a spell to burn a way out", "pick_spell": true, "outcomes": [{"chance": 1.0, "text": "{spell} goes up in flames, and the fire eats a path straight through the cactus. You walk out, smelling of smoke.", "do": [{"op": "lose_spell"}]}]}, {"label": "Force your way out", "outcomes": [{"chance": 1.0, "text": "You push through the spines until you come out the other side. It hurts: you lose 5 HP.", "do": [{"op": "damage", "n": 5}]}]}, {"label": "Follow the voice", "outcomes": [{"chance": 1.0, "text": "Deeper still. More spines, another {n} HP. The humming has turned into words you can almost understand.", "do": [{"op": "damage", "min": 1, "max": 3}], "then": {"options": [{"label": "Ignite a spell to burn a way out", "pick_spell": true, "outcomes": [{"chance": 1.0, "text": "{spell} goes up in flames, and the fire eats a path straight through the cactus. You walk out, smelling of smoke.", "do": [{"op": "lose_spell"}]}]}, {"label": "Force your way out", "outcomes": [{"chance": 1.0, "text": "You push through the spines until you come out the other side. It hurts: you lose 5 HP.", "do": [{"op": "damage", "n": 5}]}]}, {"label": "Follow the voice", "outcomes": [{"chance": 1.0, "text": "At the heart of the maze, the voice belongs to an old cactus in bloom. As its spines take another {n} HP, it drops something warm into your hands: the Cactus Heart. When you look up, the way out is right behind you.", "do": [{"op": "damage", "min": 1, "max": 3}, {"op": "artifact_id", "id": "cactus_heart"}]}]}]}}]}]}}]}]},
	# Climate Change: you give the water spirit a spell (it's gone); what you get depends on how many Water Essence its
